    "body": "Ugh, I have a fix for the line numbers pointing wrong on my laptop (it's caused by me badly handling comment-stripping).  It's trying to point to one of the lines in the early-600s, because you're using a 1-space indent but haven't told Bikeshed that (it defaults to assuming a 4-space indent for markdown purposes - this includes html).",
